# game/ch14.rpy:13
translate english ch14_0db65ea3:

    # n "周三晚上，爸爸出差在外地，妈妈加班还没回来，阿狐独自在家写作业。"
    n "Wednesday evening. Dad was away on a business trip, Mom was working late, and Ahu was home alone doing homework."

# game/ch14.rpy:14
translate english ch14_91004c8f:

    # n "八点整，平板突然响起来电铃声——屏幕上跳出「爸爸」的名字和头像，是视频通话。"
    n "At eight sharp, the tablet rang — \"Dad\"'s name and avatar popped up on screen. A video call."

# game/ch14.rpy:15
translate english ch14_29358e76:

    # n "接通后，画面里出现爸爸的脸，背景看起来像酒店房间。"
    n "He answered, and Dad's face filled the screen, the background looking like a hotel room."

# game/ch14.rpy:16
translate english ch14_65b27577:

    # dad serious "阿狐，是爸爸。别开外放，我有急事跟你说。"
    dad serious "Ahu, it's Dad. Don't put me on speakerphone — I have something urgent to tell you."

# game/ch14.rpy:19
translate english ch14_dcbfe643:

    # dad serious "爸爸刚才开车不小心蹭到了人，对方开口要2万私了，不然就要报警扣车。爸爸卡里钱不够，急用钱，这事先别告诉你妈，她胆子小会慌。"
    dad serious "Dad just scraped someone while driving. They're demanding 20,000 to settle privately, or they'll call the police and impound the car. Dad's card is short — this is urgent. Don't tell your mom yet; she frightens easily."

# game/ch14.rpy:20
translate english ch14_165f31e9:

    # dad serious "你用你妈手机的支付密码，先把钱转给对方账号，明天爸爸回去补上，千万保密！"
    dad serious "Use the payment password on your mom's phone and transfer the money to their account first. Dad will make it up when I'm back tomorrow. Keep it absolutely secret!"

# game/ch14.rpy:34
translate english ch14_A_ff82329a:

    # n "画面里爸爸的脸、声音都对，可「瞒着妈妈转2万」这个要求，让阿狐心里咯噔一下。"
    n "The face and voice on screen were all Dad's — but the demand to \"hide it from Mom and transfer 20,000\" made Ahu's heart skip."

# game/ch14.rpy:35
translate english ch14_A_793fa08d:

    # think serious "爸爸说过，家里大事小事从来都是两个人商量，真出车祸第一件事是报警和保险，绝不会只瞒着我一个人！老师还讲过AI换脸骗局……"
    think serious "Dad always says big or small, family matters get decided together. A real accident means police and insurance first — never hiding it from just me! And teacher covered AI face-swap scams..."

# game/ch14.rpy:36
translate english ch14_A_ecaea759:

    # mc serious "爸，这么大的事不能瞒着妈妈。你先挂了，我打你手机确认一下。"
    mc serious "Dad, something this big can't be hidden from Mom. Hang up — I'll call your phone to confirm."

# game/ch14.rpy:37
translate english ch14_A_765e1600:

    # n "阿狐挂断视频，立刻拨打爸爸的手机号——爸爸正在外地开会，手机通了，他说根本没打过视频，也没出任何事故！"
    n "Ahu ended the video and dialed Dad's number at once — Dad was at a meeting out of town. The call connected: he'd never made any video call, and there had been no accident!"

# game/ch14.rpy:38
translate english ch14_A_23db53a1:

    # dad laugh "儿子，有人用AI换脸冒充爸爸行骗！你做得太对了，钱一分都不能转，把通话记录截图发给妈妈，我们马上报警。"
    dad laugh "Son, someone used an AI face swap to impersonate me! You did exactly right — not one cent transfers. Screenshot the call record for your mom, and we're reporting this to the police right away."

# game/ch14.rpy:41
translate english ch14_A_4c913358:

    # police laugh "教科书级别的处理！AI能造假脸、造假声，但造假不了「回拨核实」。记住：涉及转账的视频电话，一律挂断，回拨本人号码确认！"
    police laugh "Textbook handling! AI can fake faces and voices, but it can't fake a callback. Remember: any video call involving money — hang up and dial the person's real number to confirm!"

# game/ch14.rpy:53
translate english ch14_B_737c8062:

    # mc confused "你在哪个城市？蹭到人了怎么不报警走保险？对方怎么开口就是2万？"
    mc confused "Which city are you in? If you scraped someone, why no police or insurance? How do they open with exactly 20,000?"

# game/ch14.rpy:54
translate english ch14_B_5a300d01:

    # dad serious "别问那么多！对方是本地混混，报警只会更麻烦，私了最省事！爸爸赶时间，两万块晚一分都不行！"
    dad serious "Stop asking! They're local thugs — police just complicate things, settling privately is easiest! Dad's in a hurry — that 20,000 can't wait even a minute!"

# game/ch14.rpy:55
translate english ch14_B_2b24e329:

    # n "对方的回答含糊其辞，只会催着转钱。"
    n "The answers were vague and evasive — only the urging to transfer was clear."

# game/ch14.rpy:56
translate english ch14_B_63c4cad6:

    # dad serious "你要是心疼爸爸，就别磨蹭！用妈妈的手机转，账号我现在发给你！"
    dad serious "If you care about your dad, quit stalling! Use your mom's phone — I'm sending the account number now!"

# game/ch14.rpy:70
translate english ch14_B1_71f40570:

    # n "阿狐越听越心慌，但「不许问、快转钱」的态度让他起了疑心。"
    n "The more Ahu heard, the more panicked he got — but the \"no questions, transfer now\" attitude raised his suspicion."

# game/ch14.rpy:71
translate english ch14_B1_b03d0ec3:

    # think worried "视频里明明是爸爸，可他答不上任何细节，只会催钱……不行，先核实！"
    think worried "It looks like Dad on video, but he can't answer a single detail — only push for money... No. Verify first!"

# game/ch14.rpy:72
translate english ch14_B1_d44b76df:

    # n "阿狐挂断视频，先给妈妈打电话说明情况，又拨打爸爸手机。爸爸说根本没出事，也提醒他这是新型AI诈骗。"
    n "Ahu ended the video, called Mom first to explain, then dialed Dad's phone. Dad said nothing had happened, and warned him this was the new AI scam."

# game/ch14.rpy:73
translate english ch14_B1_fab91df2:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这是「AI换脸」骗局！以后遇到视频借钱的，先挂断、再回拨、问细节，三步缺一不可。"
    mom serious "Sweetie, this is the \"AI face swap\" scam! From now on, any video call asking for money: hang up, call back, ask for details — all three steps, no skipping."

# game/ch14.rpy:74
translate english ch14_B1_166b15c7:

    # n "一家人连夜把通话记录交给警察，并约定了只有全家知道的安全暗号。"
    n "That night the family handed the call records to the police and set a family safety password only they knew."

# game/ch14.rpy:77
translate english ch14_B1_03e73ced:

    # police laugh "先核实、再行动，满分！AI换脸骗得了眼睛，骗不了核实。凡是视频、电话里谈到钱的，挂断回拨，一个细节都别放过！"
    police laugh "Verify first, act second — full marks! AI face swaps can fool your eyes, but not a verification call. Any video or phone call about money: hang up, call back, and let no detail slide!"

# game/ch14.rpy:89
translate english ch14_B2_006c3937:

    # mc serious "那你说说，我们家的安全暗号是什么？上个月全家去哪儿玩的？"
    mc serious "Then tell me — what's our family safety password? Where did we go as a family last month?"

# game/ch14.rpy:90
translate english ch14_B2_b813f60f:

    # dad serious "暗号？什么暗号？上个月……不就是出去玩了吗！你别问这些没用的，快转钱！"
    dad serious "Password? What password? Last month... we went out, didn't we! Stop asking useless questions and transfer the money!"

# game/ch14.rpy:91
translate english ch14_B2_e756071f:

    # think serious "答不上暗号，也说不出去了哪儿——视频里的「爸爸」是假的！"
    think serious "Can't answer the password, can't say where we went — the \"Dad\" on this video is fake!"

# game/ch14.rpy:92
translate english ch14_B2_f53766f4:

    # mc serious "我爸不可能答不上暗号。你是用AI换脸的骗子！"
    mc serious "My dad could never forget the password. You're an AI face-swap scammer!"

# game/ch14.rpy:93
translate english ch14_B2_3c5ee92a:

    # n "阿狐挂断视频并拉黑。他马上联系妈妈，妈妈核实后确认爸爸平安无事。"
    n "Ahu ended the video and blocked them. He contacted Mom right away, and her check confirmed Dad was safe and sound."

# game/ch14.rpy:94
translate english ch14_B2_8a6e7034:

    # n "一家人把聊天记录交给警察，并更新了安全暗号。"
    n "The family handed the chat records to the police and updated the safety password."

# game/ch14.rpy:97
translate english ch14_B2_015a1ee6:

    # police serious "「安全暗号」用得好！假脸能造，假声音能仿，但骗子猜不出你家的秘密约定。建议每个家庭都设一个暗号，专门用来核实身份！"
    police serious "Great use of the \"safety password\"! Faces can be faked, voices cloned — but scammers can't guess your family's secret agreement. Every family should have a password just for identity checks!"

# game/ch14.rpy:109
translate english ch14_B3_be4fef70:

    # n "画面和声音实在太像爸爸了，阿狐相信了大半，蹑手蹑脚去拿妈妈的手机。"
    n "The face and voice were so much like Dad's that Ahu believed most of it, and tiptoed to get Mom's phone."

# game/ch14.rpy:110
translate english ch14_B3_6a026baf:

    # n "支付页面要求输入密码，阿狐试着输了一遍妈妈的常用密码——错误；又试了一遍，还是错误。"
    n "The payment page asked for the password. Ahu tried Mom's usual one — wrong. Tried again — still wrong."

# game/ch14.rpy:111
translate english ch14_B3_50d20a85:

    # n "第三次输入时，妈妈加班回来了，一把按住手机：你在干什么？！"
    n "On his third try, Mom came home from overtime and grabbed the phone: What are you doing?!"

# game/ch14.rpy:112
translate english ch14_B3_f5fefb79:

    # n "听阿狐讲完，妈妈立刻回拨爸爸电话核实——果然是AI换脸骗局，根本没出车祸。"
    n "After hearing Ahu out, Mom immediately called Dad back to verify — sure enough, an AI face-swap scam; there had been no accident."

# game/ch14.rpy:113
translate english ch14_B3_d39d82c9:

    # mom serious "太危险了！你已经摸到支付环节了！以后谁在视频里让你转账，先挂断、再回拨，密码谁都不能试！"
    mom serious "That was dangerous! You were already at the payment step! From now on: anyone asking you to transfer on video — hang up, call back, and never try passwords!"

# game/ch14.rpy:116
translate english ch14_B3_134051a4:

    # police serious "好险！幸好支付密码没试出来，不然两万块就没了。记住：AI换脸骗局的最后一步永远是「密码」和「转账」，这两道门谁也敲不开！"
    police serious "Close call! Thankfully the password never worked, or 20,000 yuan would be gone. Remember: the final steps of every AI face-swap scam are always the \"password\" and the \"transfer\". Those two doors open for no one!"

# game/ch14.rpy:128
translate english ch14_C_07c04277:

    # n "阿狐一心想着「救爸爸」，轻手轻脚拿到了妈妈的手机。"
    n "Fixated on \"saving Dad\", Ahu quietly got hold of Mom's phone."

# game/ch14.rpy:129
translate english ch14_C_43446315:

    # think laugh "爸爸平时最疼我了，这次换我救他！"
    think laugh "Dad dotes on me — this time it's my turn to save him!"

# game/ch14.rpy:130
translate english ch14_C_91c51a7f:

    # mc laugh "爸，我拿到妈妈的手机了，账号多少？我马上转！"
    mc laugh "Dad, I've got Mom's phone. What's the account number? I'll transfer right now!"

# game/ch14.rpy:131
translate english ch14_C_408b8bdd:

    # dad serious "好儿子！账号我发你，先转2万。转完删掉记录，千万别让你妈发现！"
    dad serious "Good son! I'm sending the account — transfer the 20,000 first. Delete the records after, and never let your mom find out!"

# game/ch14.rpy:132
translate english ch14_C_d357b229:

    # n "对方发来一个陌生账户。阿狐输入转账金额，页面弹出支付密码输入框。"
    n "The scammer sent a stranger's account. Ahu entered the amount, and the payment password box popped up."

# game/ch14.rpy:146
translate english ch14_C1_c960b82e:

    # n "支付密码键盘弹出的那一刻，阿狐的手指停住了。"
    n "The instant the payment keypad appeared, Ahu's finger froze."

# game/ch14.rpy:147
translate english ch14_C1_158c2428:

    # think serious "等等！老师的反诈课讲过AI换脸：视频能造假，声音能仿冒！爸爸出事绝不会瞒着妈妈，更不会让小学生转2万！"
    think serious "Wait! The anti-fraud class covered AI face swaps: videos can be faked, voices imitated! Dad would never hide an accident from Mom — and never make a schoolkid transfer 20,000!"

# game/ch14.rpy:148
translate english ch14_C1_d1e2abb4:

    # mc serious "这钱我不转。你要真是我爸，接我回拨的电话！"
    mc serious "I'm not transferring. If you're really my dad, answer my callback!"

# game/ch14.rpy:149
translate english ch14_C1_31289a97:

    # n "阿狐果断锁屏，拨打爸爸手机——爸爸正在开会，平安无事！"
    n "Ahu locked the screen and dialed Dad's phone — he was in a meeting, safe and sound!"

# game/ch14.rpy:150
translate english ch14_C1_b92f4975:

    # n "他又马上联系妈妈，一家人报警并提交了通话证据，反诈中心很快发布了预警。"
    n "He then contacted Mom at once. The family reported to the police and submitted the call evidence; the anti-fraud center soon issued a warning."

# game/ch14.rpy:151
translate english ch14_C1_aacc5e17:

    # dad laugh "儿子，你今天守住了全家最重要的防线，爸爸为你骄傲！"
    dad laugh "Son, today you held the family's most important line of defense. Dad is proud of you!"

# game/ch14.rpy:154
translate english ch14_C1_a33466f9:

    # police serious "面对「以假乱真」的视频还能悬崖勒马，了不起！AI换脸再逼真，也怕「挂断回拨」这一招。涉及转账，先核实身份，再谈其他！"
    police serious "Pulling back from the cliff in front of a lifelike video — remarkable! However real an AI face swap looks, it fears one move: hang up and call back. Anything involving transfers — verify identity first, everything else later!"

# game/ch14.rpy:166
translate english ch14_C2_489422b6:

    # n "阿狐想不出支付密码，便先用自己手机里的零花钱转了2000元「应急」。"
    n "Unable to guess the payment password, Ahu sent 2,000 yuan of his own allowance \"for the emergency\"."

# game/ch14.rpy:167
translate english ch14_C2_350943a5:

    # think laugh "先把救命钱转过去，剩下的等妈妈回来再说。"
    think laugh "Send the emergency money first; the rest can wait until Mom's home."

# game/ch14.rpy:168
translate english ch14_C2_382f69d8:

    # n "2000元刚转走，「爸爸」立刻发来消息：怎么才转2000？快用你妈手机补上1万8，晚了对方就报警了！"
    n "The moment the 2,000 yuan left, \"Dad\" messaged: only 2,000? Use your mom's phone to cover the remaining 18,000 — any later and they're calling the police!"

# game/ch14.rpy:169
translate english ch14_C2_8a80deae:

    # mc confused "说好的救急，怎么比骗子催得还紧？"
    mc confused "For an \"emergency\", they push harder than a scammer... wait—"

# game/ch14.rpy:170
translate english ch14_C2_4dc8a746:

    # n "这时真爸爸来了电话，说自己正在开会、一切安好。阿狐如梦初醒，和妈妈一起报警，但2000元已被转走。"
    n "Just then the real Dad called — he was in a meeting, everything fine. Ahu woke as from a dream and reported it with Mom, but the 2,000 yuan was already gone."

# game/ch14.rpy:173
translate english ch14_C2_320e5b02:

    # police serious "「先转一部分」也是上当！AI骗局里，骗子要的不是应急，而是你的全部。被骗的第一时间就该挂断核实，而不是替骗子「凑钱」！"
    police serious "\"Send a part first\" is falling for it too! In AI scams, the scammer doesn't want an emergency fund — they want everything. The moment you suspect, hang up and verify — never \"chip in\" for the scammer!"

# game/ch14.rpy:185
translate english ch14_C3_01c220de:

    # n "阿狐记住了妈妈输密码时的动作，试着拼了几次，竟然输对了支付密码。"
    n "Ahu remembered the way Mom typed her password, tried a few combinations — and actually got it right."

# game/ch14.rpy:186
translate english ch14_C3_f1addfb1:

    # n "2万元分两笔转了出去。转账成功，屏幕里的「爸爸」立刻挂断了电话，再拨过去已是关机。"
    n "The 20,000 yuan went out in two transfers. The second it succeeded, the \"Dad\" on screen hung up — and the next call went straight to a powered-off phone."

# game/ch14.rpy:187
translate english ch14_C3_9ae347db:

    # n "十分钟后，真爸爸来电说自己正在开会。阿狐拿着手机，手都在发抖。"
    n "Ten minutes later, the real Dad called to say he was in a meeting. Ahu held the phone, hands shaking."

# game/ch14.rpy:188
translate english ch14_C3_2a22e43a:

    # mc sad "爸……刚才是骗子冒充你，把妈妈卡里的2万块转走了……都怪我……"
    mc sad "Dad... a scammer just impersonated you and took 20,000 yuan from Mom's card... it's all my fault..."

# game/ch14.rpy:189
translate english ch14_C3_3ec60431:

    # n "妈妈回家后没有责备他，第一时间报警、冻结银行卡。可大部分钱，已被骗子层层转移。"
    n "When Mom got home she didn't scold him — she reported to the police and froze the bank card immediately. But most of the money had already been moved through layers of accounts."

# game/ch14.rpy:190
translate english ch14_C3_4316cd6c:

    # mom normal "钱是身外之物，你平安最重要。从今晚起，我们全家约定一个安全暗号，专门用来核实这种电话。"
    mom normal "Money is just money — what matters is that you're safe. From tonight, our family sets a safety password, used only to verify calls like this."

# game/ch14.rpy:193
translate english ch14_C3_71df8459:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！AI换脸能偷走爸爸的脸和声音，但偷不走「挂断回拨」和「家庭暗号」。视频谈钱必核实，支付密码是底线，守住了，骗局就破产！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! AI face swaps can steal Dad's face and voice, but not a callback or a family password. Money on video always gets verified, the payment password is the final line — hold it, and the scam goes bankrupt!"

